      <section class="p-4 bg-white">
        <div class="pt-16 pb-24 px-5 xs:px-8 xl:px-12 bg-lime-500 rounded-3xl">
          <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="flex mb-4 items-center">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewbox="0 0 8 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="4" fill="#1F2657"></circle>
              </svg><span class="inline-block ml-2 text-sm font-medium">The platform</span>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t pt-14" style="border-color:rgba(31,38,87,0.25)">
              <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl mb-24">Built for the three classes of migration</h1>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap -mx-4">
                <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 px-4 mb-16">
                  <div>
                    <svg width="48" height="48" viewbox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M0 8C0 3.58172 3.58172 0 8 0H40C44.4183 0 48 3.58172 48 8V40C48 44.4183 44.4183 48 40 48H8C3.58172 48 0 44.4183 0 40V8Z" fill="white"></path>
                      <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="4" fill="#1F2657"></circle>
                      <circle cx="24" cy="32" r="4" fill="#1F2657"></circle>
                      <circle cx="32" cy="16" r="4" fill="#1F2657"></circle>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                      <h5 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Data migration</h5>
                      <p class="mb-6">Move tables, records, and transactional data. Schema mapping, naming normalization, row-by-row reconciliation, audit-ready PDFs. The pain-killer for the bugs that make regulators reject your cutover.</p><a class="inline-block text-lg  font-medium hover:text-teal-700" href="pricing.html">Available in Phase 1 →</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 px-4 mb-16">
                  <div>
                    <svg width="48" height="48" viewbox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M0 8C0 3.58172 3.58172 0 8 0H40C44.4183 0 48 3.58172 48 8V40C48 44.4183 44.4183 48 40 48H8C3.58172 48 0 44.4183 0 40V8Z" fill="white"></path>
                      <rect x="23" y="8" width="2" height="12" rx="1" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="23" y="28" width="2" height="12" rx="1" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="34.6066" y="11.9792" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(45 34.6066 11.9792)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="20.4645" y="26.1213" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(45 20.4645 26.1213)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="28" y="25" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(-90 28 25)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="8" y="25" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(-90 8 25)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="26.1213" y="27.5355" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(-45 26.1213 27.5355)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                      <rect x="11.9792" y="13.3934" width="2" height="12" rx="1" transform="rotate(-45 11.9792 13.3934)" fill="#1F2657"></rect>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                      <h5 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Document migration</h5>
                      <p class="mb-6">Move files, attachments, and metadata between content systems. FileNet → SharePoint, SAP DMS → Box, OnBase → M-Files. Layout-aware extraction, content-hash + ACL reconciliation, and cryptographic chain-of-custody preserve audit chains and access controls. <span class="font-medium">Engine generally available — live content systems connect with your credentials.</span></p><a class="inline-block text-lg  font-medium hover:text-teal-700" href="#!">Phase 2 · Available now</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 px-4 mb-16 sm:mb-0">
                  <div>
                    <svg width="48" height="48" viewbox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M0 8C0 3.58172 3.58172 0 8 0H40C44.4183 0 48 3.58172 48 8V40C48 44.4183 44.4183 48 40 48H8C3.58172 48 0 44.4183 0 40V8Z" fill="white"></path>
                      <path d="M25 24C25 24.5523 24.5523 25 24 25C23.4477 25 23 24.5523 23 24C23 23.4477 23.4477 23 24 23C24.5523 23 25 23.4477 25 24Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M24 25C24.5523 25 25 24.5523 25 24C25 23.4477 24.5523 23 24 23C23.4477 23 23 23.4477 23 24C23 24.5523 23.4477 25 24 25Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M40 23C40.5523 23 41 23.4477 41 24C41 33.3888 33.3888 41 24 41C23.4477 41 23 40.5523 23 40C23 39.4477 23.4477 39 24 39C32.2843 39 39 32.2843 39 24C39 23.4477 39.4477 23 40 23Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M24 9C15.7157 9 9 15.7157 9 24C9 24.5523 8.55228 25 8 25C7.44772 25 7 24.5523 7 24C7 14.6112 14.6112 7 24 7C24.5523 7 25 7.44772 25 8C25 8.55228 24.5523 9 24 9Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M36 23C36.5523 23 37 23.4477 37 24C37 31.1797 31.1797 37 24 37C23.4477 37 23 36.5523 23 36C23 35.4477 23.4477 35 24 35C30.0751 35 35 30.0751 35 24C35 23.4477 35.4477 23 36 23Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M24 13C17.9249 13 13 17.9249 13 24C13 24.5523 12.5523 25 12 25C11.4477 25 11 24.5523 11 24C11 16.8203 16.8203 11 24 11C24.5523 11 25 11.4477 25 12C25 12.5523 24.5523 13 24 13Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M32 23C32.5523 23 33 23.4477 33 24C33 28.9706 28.9706 33 24 33C23.4477 33 23 32.5523 23 32C23 31.4477 23.4477 31 24 31C27.866 31 31 27.866 31 24C31 23.4477 31.4477 23 32 23Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M24 17C20.134 17 17 20.134 17 24C17 24.5523 16.5523 25 16 25C15.4477 25 15 24.5523 15 24C15 19.0294 19.0294 15 24 15C24.5523 15 25 15.4477 25 16C25 16.5523 24.5523 17 24 17Z" fill="#1F2657"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                      <h5 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Domain migration</h5>
                      <p class="mb-6">Move email, identity, DNS, and tenant-level systems between providers. Microsoft 365 → Google Workspace, Okta → Entra ID. Handles identity reconciliation, MFA re-enrollment, and a staged MX/DNS cutover that pauses for a named human approver. <span class="font-medium">Engine generally available — live identity providers connect with your credentials; the MX/DNS flip is deploy-gated.</span></p><a class="inline-block text-lg  font-medium hover:text-teal-700" href="#!">Phase 3 · Q1 2027</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 px-4">
                  <div>
                    <svg width="48" height="48" viewbox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <path d="M0 8C0 3.58172 3.58172 0 8 0H40C44.4183 0 48 3.58172 48 8V40C48 44.4183 44.4183 48 40 48H8C3.58172 48 0 44.4183 0 40V8Z" fill="white"></path>
                      <path d="M24 10L34 16V32L24 38L14 32V16L24 10Z" stroke="#1F2657" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      <path d="M19 23L22.5 26.5L29.5 19.5" stroke="#1F2657" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <div class="mt-6">
                      <h5 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Audit &amp; compliance</h5>
                      <p class="mb-6">Every action signed, every record traceable. Regulator-grade audit packs auto-generated for NDPA, CBN, and ISO 27001 reviews — so the first time your compliance team sees the migration, they sign it off.</p><a class="inline-block text-lg  font-medium hover:text-teal-700" href="about.html">How it works →</a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="py-12 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
          <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-24 text-center">
            <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl tracking-sm mb-16">The migration platform built by people who have lived through a failed one. </h1><a class="inline-flex py-4 px-6 items-center justify-center text-lg font-medium text-white hover:text-teal-900 border border-teal-900 hover:border-lime-500 bg-teal-900 hover:bg-lime-500 rounded-full transition duration-200" href="blog.html">Read the NRS case study</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-center">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 h-full max-w-xs sm:max-w-md md:max-w-xl mr-4 sm:mr-8"><img class="block w-full rounded-2xl" src="images/nrs-1-cranes.jpg" alt="Cranes migrating at sunset"/></div>
