      <section class="py-12 lg:py-24">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
          <div class="text-center mb-20">
            <h1 class="font-heading text-6xl mb-6">FAQ</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-700">The questions a bank's CISO, a CFO, and a tax authority's program manager have asked us this quarter.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <button class="flex w-full py-6 px-8 mb-4 items-start justify-between text-left shadow-md rounded-2xl" x-data="{ accordion: false }" x-on:click.prevent="accordion = !accordion">
              <div>
                <div class="pr-5">
                  <h5 class="text-lg font-medium">How is Migratio different from Fivetran or Airbyte?</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="overflow-hidden h-0 pr-5 duration-500" x-ref="container" :style="accordion ? 'height: ' + $refs.container.scrollHeight + 'px' : ''">
                  <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">Fivetran and Airbyte are continuous ELT pipelines built for analytics. Migratio is a cutover-grade migration platform built for one-time enterprise system replacements where every record must reconcile and every action must audit. Our AI agents (Schema Mapper, Reconciliation, Naming Library, Exception Triage, Orchestrator) catch the bugs that destroyed projects like SAAQ Quebec ($1.1B) and TSB Bank UK.</p>
                </div>
              </div><span class="flex-shrink-0">
                <div :class="{'hidden': accordion}">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 5.69995V18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    <path d="M5.69995 12H18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden" :class="{'hidden': !accordion}">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M5.69995 12H18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div></span>
            </button>
            <button class="flex w-full py-6 px-8 mb-4 items-start justify-between text-left shadow-md rounded-2xl" x-data="{ accordion: false }" x-on:click.prevent="accordion = !accordion">
              <div>
                <div class="pr-5">
                  <h5 class="text-lg font-medium">Is Migratio NDPA compliant?</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="overflow-hidden h-0 pr-5 duration-500" x-ref="container" :style="accordion ? 'height: ' + $refs.container.scrollHeight + 'px' : ''">
                  <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">Yes. Cognis Group Limited is registered with the Nigeria Data Protection Commission as an Ultra-High Level data controller, and Migratio is listed as a processing activity in our Record of Processing Activities. We can share our DPCO documentation on request.</p>
                </div>
              </div><span class="flex-shrink-0">
                <div :class="{'hidden': accordion}">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 5.69995V18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    <path d="M5.69995 12H18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden" :class="{'hidden': !accordion}">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M5.69995 12H18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  </svg>
                </div></span>
            </button>
            <button class="flex w-full py-6 px-8 mb-4 items-start justify-between text-left shadow-md rounded-2xl" x-data="{ accordion: false }" x-on:click.prevent="accordion = !accordion">
              <div>
                <div class="pr-5">
                  <h5 class="text-lg font-medium">What does an implementation look like?</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="overflow-hidden h-0 pr-5 duration-500" x-ref="container" :style="accordion ? 'height: ' + $refs.container.scrollHeight + 'px' : ''">
                  <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">Phase 0 (discovery, 2-3 weeks) — schema profiling and feasibility report. Phase 1 (implementation, 4-8 weeks) — connector configuration, mapping review, validation rule setup, user training. Phase 2 (parallel run, 2-4 weeks) — reconciliation against source-of-truth. Phase 3 (cutover, one weekend) — monitored hard cutover with war-room support.</p>
                </div>
              </div><span class="flex-shrink-0">
                <div :class="{'hidden': accordion}">
                  <svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 5.69995V18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    <path d="M5.69995 12H18.3" stroke="#1D1F1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
