                  </svg>
                </div></span>
            </button>
            <button class="flex w-full py-6 px-8 mb-4 items-start justify-between text-left shadow-md rounded-2xl" x-data="{ accordion: false }" x-on:click.prevent="accordion = !accordion">
              <div>
                <div class="pr-5">
                  <h5 class="text-lg font-medium">Does Migratio support our system?</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="overflow-hidden h-0 pr-5 duration-500" x-ref="container" :style="accordion ? 'height: ' + $refs.container.scrollHeight + 'px' : ''">
                  <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">Phase 1 ships with native connectors for Oracle, PostgreSQL, SQL Server, GraphQL, REST APIs, and the Nigerian Tax/Government pack (TaxPro Max, Rev360, TIN Validation, Tax ID). SAP HANA ships as a GA pack too — because SAP licenses its database driver to the customer, the live HANA connection runs against your own licensed instance and credentials. Custom connectors take 1-3 weeks via the Airbyte CDK. If your system isn't on the list, we'll quote a connector build during discovery.</p>
                </div>
              </div><span class="flex-shrink-0">
                <div :class="{'hidden': accordion}">
